// AKCB_DEFENSIVE_STANCE_AI — live-install tail patch for the Artisan's Kitpack
// (Chriz Balance Patch fork).
//
// Smart party AI must not use Defensive Stance while a character's "Use special
// abilities" option is off. EET's BG1-only Defensive Stance block in BDDEFAI
// ignored that option, so the protagonist kept using the stance in BG1.
// lib/defensive_stance_ai.tpa is a copy of ArtisansKitpack/lib/defensive_stance_ai.tpa,
// so the retrofit works beside any installed Kitpack version.

BACKUP ~AKCB_DEFENSIVE_STANCE_AI/backup~
AUTHOR ~Chriz (The Artisan's Kitpack — Chriz Balance Patch)~
VERSION ~1.0~

BEGIN ~Party AI: Defensive Stance obeys "Use special abilities"~ DESIGNATED 0
REQUIRE_PREDICATE FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~partyai.2da~
  ~This game has no smart party AI options (no PARTYAI.2DA), so there is nothing to fix.~

INCLUDE ~%MOD_FOLDER%/lib/defensive_stance_ai.tpa~
LAF akcb_gate_defensive_stance_party_ai INT_VAR strict = 1 END
